Oh, and I bet Oscar Wilde's brother didn't cook him up in a lab.

00:38:58.900 --> 00:39:02.900
Grant, I don't care how you came into this world.

00:39:02.900 --> 00:39:05.900
You are a Luther.

00:39:05.900 --> 00:39:08.900
You're my son.

00:39:08.900 --> 00:39:10.900
Give me your money, no.

00:39:10.900 --> 00:39:13.900
All right, all right. We don't want any trouble.

00:39:13.900 --> 00:39:14.900
No!

00:39:14.900 --> 00:39:15.900
Okay, okay. Just, please.

00:39:15.900 --> 00:39:17.900
Please take it and get out of here.

